flowchart LR
    req["Agent opens<br/>a connection"] --> rule{"A rule<br/>allows the host?"}
    rule -->|yes| fwd["Proxy forwards it,<br/>adds a bound key"]
    rule -->|no| held["Request held<br/>agent gets 403"]
    held --> you{"You press y"}
    you -->|Allow| ok["Rule for this<br/>sandbox only"]
    you -->|Dismiss| no["Stays blocked,<br/>asks again"]
    ok -.->|next attempt| fwd
